    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054480/extras/5f6b5c429a1a64d54134149b4f2b291d.poster.avif?t=1748388081\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054480/extras/5f6b5c429a1a64d54134149b4f2b291d.webm?t=1748388081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054480/extras/5f6b5c429a1a64d54134149b4f2b291d.mp4?t=1748388081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Mech Survivor Elite</strong> is a time-based survival game with action-packed gameplay and roguelite elements. <br><br>You play as Buddy, an Elite Mech Operator for the Company. <br>When a rogue AI corrupts the Company's robots, turning them against humanity, Buddy becomes the last hope. <br><br>Face relentless waves of enemies and find out: <br>How long can you survive?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054480/extras/94dfe296f6adef4fc5a472f79306dc54.poster.avif?t=1748388081\" width=326 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054480/extras/94dfe296f6adef4fc5a472f79306dc54.webm?t=1748388081\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3054480/extras/94dfe296f6adef4fc5a472f79306dc54.mp4?t=1748388081\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
